B.bEG=s(["Lyen retou pou reyinisyalizasyon an poko konfigire sou s\xe8v\xe8 a.","L\u2019URL de retour de r\xe9initialisation n\u2019est pas configur\xe9e sur le serveur.","The password-reset redirect URL is not configured on the server."],t.s)
